WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.760
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.840 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:53.680 --> 01:54.760
You look like

01:54.840 --> 01:56.600
a girl from the Moon Tribe.

01:57.280 --> 01:59.560
No one can tell
that you're a fairy from Shuiyuntian.

02:01.160 --> 02:04.840
What are you thanking me for?

02:06.200 --> 02:07.040
Thank you

02:08.320 --> 02:09.840
for changing me.

02:10.720 --> 02:12.000
I'm like a different person now.

02:15.160 --> 02:16.800
In the past,

02:16.880 --> 02:18.600
no matter how many people I killed

02:18.680 --> 02:19.560
or who I killed,

02:20.520 --> 02:22.440
even if they were my father and brother,

02:23.040 --> 02:24.000
I felt nothing at all.

02:24.480 --> 02:25.680
Although I'm alive,

02:26.200 --> 02:27.720
I was like a walking corpse.

02:28.600 --> 02:29.640
But now,

02:29.720 --> 02:30.840
I'm completely different.

02:33.400 --> 02:34.960
I knew it.

02:35.040 --> 02:36.880
You've changed.

02:36.960 --> 02:37.880
Of course.

02:38.720 --> 02:40.400
I used to be muddleheaded.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.520
But now,

02:43.800 --> 02:45.960
I understand my father's love for me

02:47.320 --> 02:49.480
and the sufferings of our people.

02:51.120 --> 02:51.960
I also understand

02:53.320 --> 02:54.360
your kindness to me

02:56.200 --> 02:58.640
and your pain
for not being able to go home.

02:59.960 --> 03:00.800
So

03:01.320 --> 03:02.480
I've decided

03:04.560 --> 03:05.960
to destroy Shuiyuntian

03:06.040 --> 03:08.200
and kill those scumbags
like Lord Yunzhong.

03:08.760 --> 03:11.040
I want to kill everyone
who has insulted you,

03:11.120 --> 03:12.520
take your home,

03:12.600 --> 03:13.680
and give it to you.

03:15.360 --> 03:17.200
By then, you can go back to Shuiyuntian

03:17.280 --> 03:19.080
and return to the real Arbiter Hall.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.440
You can even get some sun
at Yunzhong Water Pavilion daily

03:21.520 --> 03:22.440
and watch the sunrise.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.720
Whatever you want…

03:27.840 --> 03:29.360
I'm not feeling well.

03:29.440 --> 03:30.680
I'll go back and get some rest.

03:37.360 --> 03:39.720
Did you catch a cold
due to the coldness of the Oblivion River?

03:40.960 --> 03:42.280
I'm just tired.

03:42.360 --> 03:43.560
I'd like to rest for a while.

03:45.760 --> 03:47.880
You stayed up late every day
to decoct medicine for me.

03:47.960 --> 03:48.960
Of course you're tired.

03:58.680 --> 03:59.520
What are you doing?

04:00.360 --> 04:01.440
I want to stay with you

04:01.520 --> 04:02.400
and take care of you.

04:03.360 --> 04:04.320
There's no need.

04:04.400 --> 04:06.080
I want to rest alone.

04:07.760 --> 04:08.600
Have a good rest.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.840
Why did this happen?

04:41.920 --> 04:43.680
I thought everything would be different

04:43.760 --> 04:45.840
when his root of emotion recovers.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.000
But…

04:47.080 --> 04:48.200
Orchid,

04:48.800 --> 04:50.360
you're too full of yourself.

04:51.040 --> 04:52.640
How can you think

04:52.720 --> 04:54.560
that the Moon Supreme
will change because of you?

05:24.240 --> 05:25.520
My lord,

05:25.600 --> 05:26.680
I'm guilty.

05:27.640 --> 05:28.760
What did you do wrong?

05:30.000 --> 05:32.480
Today is the deadline
for finding the Chengying Sword fragments.

05:33.200 --> 05:35.400
But I haven't found the last fragment.

05:36.040 --> 05:36.920
Please punish me.

05:40.960 --> 05:41.880
I won't punish you.

05:41.960 --> 05:43.680
Thank you for your generosity.

05:49.320 --> 05:50.360
Anything else?

05:50.840 --> 05:53.080
Since I worked for you,

05:53.160 --> 05:54.440
I have spared no effort

05:54.520 --> 05:55.960
in doing everything you ordered

05:56.040 --> 05:57.120
and have never slacked off.

05:58.280 --> 06:00.440
But in finding
the Chengying Sword fragments,

06:01.120 --> 06:02.040
I actually…

06:03.000 --> 06:04.440
- Actually…
- What?

06:05.720 --> 06:07.920
Actually, I didn't do my best.

06:09.880 --> 06:11.320
Because if I find all the fragments

06:11.400 --> 06:12.640
and rebuild the Chengying Sword,

06:13.200 --> 06:14.840
you will kill Fairy Orchid immediately.

06:16.840 --> 06:19.440
Whenever I thought about this,
I felt very sad.

06:19.520 --> 06:20.720
So I slacked off.

06:21.440 --> 06:22.720
Please punish me.

06:28.000 --> 06:29.640
Since you can't find it,

06:29.720 --> 06:31.880
maybe the last fragment

06:31.960 --> 06:33.440
has long been destroyed.

06:34.000 --> 06:35.880
I don't think this sword can be forged.

06:35.960 --> 06:37.160
Don't look for it anymore.

06:37.240 --> 06:38.400
Work on other matters.

06:39.440 --> 06:40.280
Yes.

06:41.000 --> 06:43.040
What about the fragments I found?

06:43.120 --> 06:44.240
Throw them all away.

06:46.560 --> 06:47.400
Yes.

07:03.440 --> 07:04.280
Lord Xunfeng.

07:06.080 --> 07:06.960
Wait.

07:13.600 --> 07:14.560
What are these?

07:17.160 --> 07:18.680
Are these the fragments

07:19.520 --> 07:20.800
of the ancient Chengying Sword?

07:22.400 --> 07:23.800
You have a good eye, Lord Xunfeng.

07:23.880 --> 07:25.080
However,

07:25.160 --> 07:27.160
the last fragment is still missing.

07:27.240 --> 07:28.280
I can't rebuild it.

07:28.760 --> 07:30.320
My lord asked me to throw them away.

07:30.400 --> 07:31.640
Throw them away?

07:32.640 --> 07:34.160
Isn't it a pity to throw them away?

07:35.480 --> 07:36.920
Since my brother doesn't want them,

07:37.480 --> 07:38.720
why don't you give them to me?

07:39.800 --> 07:41.600
Maybe I can find

07:42.320 --> 07:43.240
the last piece.

07:46.840 --> 07:48.000
What's the matter?

07:49.320 --> 07:51.320
You can't even give me
what my brother doesn't want?

07:53.440 --> 07:55.400
Do you have any respect for me?

07:55.880 --> 07:56.720
Yes.

07:58.160 --> 08:00.000
But my lord said

08:00.080 --> 08:01.000
the last fragment

08:01.080 --> 08:02.520
might have already been pulverized.

08:02.600 --> 08:03.600
We can't complete them anymore.

08:04.520 --> 08:06.520
I don't think
you should waste your time on it.

08:11.840 --> 08:14.920
HAOTIAN TOWER, SHUIYUNTIAN

08:21.040 --> 08:23.040
I thought the person my brother would send

08:23.120 --> 08:24.440
was Supreme Liyuan.

08:25.200 --> 08:26.440
I didn't expect it to be you.

08:27.920 --> 08:28.800
No.

08:30.080 --> 08:31.640
I really miss you.

08:31.720 --> 08:34.080
I was worried that you would suffer
in Haotian Tower.

08:35.080 --> 08:35.919
That's why

08:36.679 --> 08:39.120
I begged Lord Yunzhong
to let me visit you.

08:39.200 --> 08:40.640
Save your breath.

08:42.240 --> 08:43.280
Go back and tell him

08:44.240 --> 08:45.800
that my love for Orchid

08:47.160 --> 08:48.240
will never change.

08:49.120 --> 08:51.800
Since she willingly colluded
with the Moon Tribe,

08:52.680 --> 08:54.520
why do you still care so much about her?

08:59.280 --> 09:01.560
Dongfang Qingcang deceived her.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.120
It's my fault.

09:07.520 --> 09:08.720
I was too cowardly.

09:10.440 --> 09:11.600
I didn't dare to approach her

09:12.640 --> 09:13.480
and protect her.

09:14.520 --> 09:15.360
I made her

09:16.720 --> 09:18.200
feel disappointed with Shuiyuntian and me.

09:21.240 --> 09:22.160
Lord Changheng.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.400
Although your wounds have recovered,

09:25.000 --> 09:26.400
your Immortal Pond hasn't.

09:26.960 --> 09:28.720
You can't stay in the tower anymore.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.200
I can tell

09:31.840 --> 09:35.040
that Lord Yunzhong
doesn't really want to imprison you.

09:35.120 --> 09:36.400
He allowed me to enter the tower

09:36.480 --> 09:38.320
because there's still a way out of this.

09:39.520 --> 09:41.200
As long as you apologize to him,

09:42.640 --> 09:43.760
you can surely get out.

09:47.280 --> 09:48.320
Apologize?

09:49.520 --> 09:50.680
What mistake did I make?

09:51.280 --> 09:52.960
Is loving someone

09:53.040 --> 09:54.280
and wanting to protect her

09:54.840 --> 09:55.920
a mistake?

09:59.640 --> 10:00.480
If so,

10:02.680 --> 10:04.080
I'd rather keep making mistakes.

10:11.320 --> 10:12.440
Lord Changheng,

10:15.240 --> 10:16.360
don't be sad.

10:19.280 --> 10:20.120
She

10:22.400 --> 10:23.680
will come back to you.

10:39.320 --> 10:41.160
I saw you getting married

10:45.040 --> 10:46.640
to Orchid in the Tianji Mirror.

10:48.560 --> 10:49.400
Really?

10:51.120 --> 10:52.920
The Tianji Mirror is a destiny tool.

10:53.480 --> 10:54.720
The prophecy it makes

10:55.320 --> 10:56.400
will definitely come true.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.320
But I'm engaged to the Goddess.

11:02.520 --> 11:04.000
How can I marry Orchid?

11:04.560 --> 11:06.600
It's in Yunmeng Lake.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.440
What I saw

11:10.520 --> 11:12.040
is that you became a mortal

11:13.200 --> 11:15.040
and married Orchid.

11:21.080 --> 11:21.920
Danyin.

11:22.520 --> 11:23.800
I'm begging you.

11:23.880 --> 11:25.120
Since you can enter the tower,

11:25.200 --> 11:26.800
you can help me get out, right?

11:26.880 --> 11:27.800
Please help me.

11:28.880 --> 11:30.200
What are you going to do?

11:33.920 --> 11:35.080
Jump into Shenshui Hall

11:36.120 --> 11:37.720
for tribulations in the Mortal World.

11:40.120 --> 11:41.440
Lord Changheng,

11:42.360 --> 11:43.560
are you crazy?

11:45.440 --> 11:46.680
Tribulations are unpredictable.

11:47.440 --> 11:48.720
If you can't deal with them,

11:49.960 --> 11:51.520
your soul may dissipate

11:51.600 --> 11:53.600
and you can't ever return to Shuiyuntian.

11:54.240 --> 11:55.080
Danyin.

11:55.640 --> 11:57.080
This is my only chance.

11:57.160 --> 11:58.280
Please help me.

12:02.640 --> 12:03.960
I don't understand.

12:04.600 --> 12:05.640
You don't understand my feeling

12:06.360 --> 12:08.520
because you've never loved someone
as I do.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.240
Danyin.

12:15.800 --> 12:16.880
I'm begging you.

12:16.960 --> 12:17.960
Please help me.

12:21.720 --> 12:26.680
SHENSHUI HALL, SHUIYUNTIAN

12:51.240 --> 12:52.080
Danyin.

12:52.920 --> 12:53.840
Thank you.

12:55.360 --> 12:56.720
If we can meet in our next lives,

12:58.040 --> 13:00.360
I'll surely repay you with my life.

13:39.400 --> 13:40.640
You said

13:42.800 --> 13:44.960
I don't know how it feels to love someone.

13:48.080 --> 13:49.200
You're wrong.

13:54.800 --> 13:55.800
I know it.

14:00.440 --> 14:02.000
I know it better than anyone.

14:52.680 --> 14:54.440
I have no parents.

14:55.280 --> 14:57.240
Why do I keep having these dreams lately?

14:58.760 --> 15:00.760
It turns out to be an old friend.

15:01.320 --> 15:02.720
I read that

15:03.200 --> 15:06.320
you know all living creatures
in this world.

15:07.720 --> 15:09.800
You are special.

15:09.880 --> 15:10.760
Me?

15:12.120 --> 15:13.520
Who exactly am I?

15:14.880 --> 15:16.280
Who am I?

15:19.200 --> 15:20.680
How strange.

15:20.760 --> 15:22.720
Why do I feel cold today?

15:24.560 --> 15:25.400
My lord,

15:26.280 --> 15:27.440
you are possessed by Hellfire.

15:28.200 --> 15:29.480
Why would you feel cold?

15:39.440 --> 15:40.600
Orchid, stop.

15:40.680 --> 15:41.720
Let's go.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.720
It's not time yet.

15:46.320 --> 15:48.080
If I leave now,

15:48.160 --> 15:49.760
the coldness I endured all morning

15:49.840 --> 15:51.280
would be in vain.

15:51.360 --> 15:52.760
What do you want?

15:52.840 --> 15:54.560
Do you want to freeze yourself to death?

15:54.640 --> 15:55.800
I want to know my true form.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.520
I must find out

15:58.120 --> 16:00.000
what I am.

16:00.760 --> 16:04.040
How can you know your true form
by just freezing yourself for a few hours?

16:06.480 --> 16:08.120
Miss, I'm begging you.

16:08.200 --> 16:10.040
If anything happens to you,

16:10.120 --> 16:11.760
the Moon Supreme will kill me.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.200
I've thought about it.

16:16.160 --> 16:17.480
I'm neither an orchid

16:17.560 --> 16:18.880
nor someone from the Moon Tribe.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.320
Maybe…

16:20.960 --> 16:23.800
Maybe I'm a Rhodiola rosea
from the Northernmost Ocean glacier

16:24.280 --> 16:26.720
that Lord Changheng just recovered, but…

16:26.800 --> 16:28.760
But not added
to the eight-immortal system yet.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.920
What are you talking about?

16:32.000 --> 16:33.560
Stop messing around.

16:33.640 --> 16:35.320
Look at you.
Your face is blue from the cold.

16:36.440 --> 16:37.640
It's so cold.

16:37.720 --> 16:38.720
Let's go.

16:45.760 --> 16:46.840
What are you doing?

16:47.360 --> 16:48.800
Don't do this even if you want to die.

16:55.480 --> 16:56.880
I'm not a Rhodiola rosea either.

16:57.560 --> 16:58.960
Then what am I?

16:59.640 --> 17:01.160
You are a Xishan orchid.

17:01.240 --> 17:02.600
Didn't I tell you before?

17:02.680 --> 17:04.960
I took care of you according to the book.

17:05.040 --> 17:06.400
It worked.

17:06.480 --> 17:08.160
That means you are an orchid plant.

17:09.400 --> 17:10.240
But…

17:10.720 --> 17:13.480
But the Great Turtle
didn't know my true form.

17:15.440 --> 17:16.960
Maybe there was a mistake.

17:17.599 --> 17:19.119
The Great Turtle never makes mistakes.

17:22.079 --> 17:23.440
I've seen my true form.

17:24.160 --> 17:25.240
It's weird.

17:26.160 --> 17:27.160
My leaves,

17:27.720 --> 17:28.640
my stems…

17:30.160 --> 17:32.120
I don't know what I am either.

17:32.800 --> 17:33.640
At first,

17:34.120 --> 17:36.840
I thought I was just an ordinary plant.

17:37.600 --> 17:38.440
But now…

17:42.600 --> 17:43.880
Moon Supreme Lord,

17:43.960 --> 17:45.200
can you tell me

17:45.280 --> 17:46.120
what am I?

17:51.360 --> 17:53.360
I don't care what you are.

17:55.200 --> 17:58.120
I only know you're not a plant
no one cares about.

17:58.680 --> 18:00.040
You are the most important person

18:00.840 --> 18:02.240
that I care about the most

18:02.320 --> 18:03.360
in the three realms.

18:05.440 --> 18:07.840
No one can take you from me.

18:08.840 --> 18:10.120
From now on,

18:10.720 --> 18:12.640
you must stay with me

18:12.720 --> 18:14.320
and be with me forever.

18:26.120 --> 18:27.000
No.

18:34.720 --> 18:35.760
You're the Moon Supreme.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.400
You want to destroy the Fairy Realm

18:39.120 --> 18:40.720
and kill everyone in Shuiyuntian.

18:40.800 --> 18:42.720
They treat you as a traitor,

18:44.320 --> 18:46.400
but you still treat them as your people.

18:47.240 --> 18:49.600
As long as I know
that I'm not a traitor, that's enough.

18:51.960 --> 18:53.200
Even if I die,

18:54.640 --> 18:56.680
I won't betray Shuiyuntian.

18:58.040 --> 18:59.760
Are you going to betray me?

19:05.600 --> 19:06.880
What do you want?

19:16.560 --> 19:17.480
Tell me.

19:18.120 --> 19:19.480
What do you want?

19:26.000 --> 19:28.120
We belong to different tribes.

19:29.080 --> 19:30.560
How can you talk about betrayal?

19:31.880 --> 19:34.320
You are the high-ranking Moon Supreme.

19:34.920 --> 19:35.800
And I

19:36.640 --> 19:39.440
am just a plant
who doesn't even know who she is.

19:41.600 --> 19:43.320
How can we talk about ties

19:44.000 --> 19:45.040
of comradeship between us?

19:49.000 --> 19:51.680
Please stop wasting time on me anymore,
Moon Supreme Lord.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.600
I don't deserve this honor.

19:55.960 --> 19:58.680
You said there are no ties
of comradeship between us.

20:00.360 --> 20:02.280
Then why do you always stay by my side

20:03.400 --> 20:05.040
and do so many things for me?

20:06.080 --> 20:08.120
You revived my seven emotions

20:08.200 --> 20:10.080
and let me feel emotions.

20:10.720 --> 20:12.240
Why are you doing this now?

20:19.000 --> 20:20.160
I'm sorry.

20:25.000 --> 20:26.680
What is the reason for this?

20:33.480 --> 20:35.320
You're the leader of the Moon Tribe.

20:37.120 --> 20:39.040
You're carrying the mission
of the Moon Tribe.

20:40.840 --> 20:42.040
I'm the same.

20:44.560 --> 20:46.480
Shuiyuntian is my home.

20:47.080 --> 20:49.400
I just want to return your home to you.

20:50.480 --> 20:51.800
And you just said

20:53.200 --> 20:55.000
that you might not be a fairy.

20:55.080 --> 20:56.520
But the people I care about

20:58.960 --> 21:00.280
are all there

21:02.200 --> 21:03.560
aside from you.

21:06.920 --> 21:08.080
Let me ask you.

21:08.640 --> 21:10.200
When you go to the Spirit Lock Gate

21:11.800 --> 21:12.960
and Changheng stops you,

21:14.840 --> 21:16.000
what will you do?

21:16.600 --> 21:17.440
I'll kill him.

21:20.200 --> 21:21.720
What will you do

21:22.960 --> 21:24.280
if my master stops you?

21:25.240 --> 21:26.800
Since she's your master,

21:27.440 --> 21:28.600
if she's willing to surrender,

21:29.360 --> 21:30.720
I will spare her life.

21:31.600 --> 21:33.760
What if she refuses to surrender

21:34.760 --> 21:37.080
and insists on defending Shuiyuntian
even if she dies?

21:37.640 --> 21:39.560
Can you really not give up the Fairy Tribe

21:40.400 --> 21:41.720
for me?

21:42.920 --> 21:45.680
Can you give up the hatred of Moon Tribe

21:47.240 --> 21:50.160
and your promise to your father
and your people?

22:33.640 --> 22:38.360
ANCIENT BATTLEFIELD, XUANXU REALM

22:38.440 --> 22:39.520
Moon Supreme.

22:40.120 --> 22:42.200
I've confirmed the Hellfire wound
on her body.

22:42.280 --> 22:44.640
She's indeed the reincarnation
of Lady Chidi.

22:56.840 --> 22:58.280
After today,

22:59.480 --> 23:01.760
we'll be able to take revenge.

23:26.280 --> 23:27.480
Moon Supreme.

23:30.440 --> 23:31.480
I knew it.

23:32.040 --> 23:33.840
You've changed.

23:35.560 --> 23:36.680
Why are you hesitating?

23:53.120 --> 23:54.160
Stop.

24:14.480 --> 24:15.440
Why…

24:16.200 --> 24:17.240
Why did this happen?

24:18.480 --> 24:20.040
Why didn't the primordial spirit vanish

24:21.080 --> 24:22.480
after being taken out?

24:32.520 --> 24:34.360
Regardless if you're an immortal
or a mortal,

24:34.440 --> 24:36.200
you have a one-leaf Destiny Book.

24:36.280 --> 24:38.400
Your destiny is written
in the Destiny Books.

24:38.480 --> 24:40.960
I used to sit there every day
to fix Destiny Books.

24:41.040 --> 24:42.200
But it's not this place.

24:42.280 --> 24:43.840
These are all fake.

24:43.920 --> 24:46.040
The actual fate tree is in Shuiyuntian.

24:46.120 --> 24:47.760
I know. Don't change the subject.

24:47.840 --> 24:49.320
Tell me about immortals
experiencing tribulations.

24:49.400 --> 24:51.640
When immortals
experience tribulations as mortals,

24:51.720 --> 24:53.800
there are different fates in each life.

24:53.880 --> 24:55.520
They must follow the fate poem

24:55.600 --> 24:56.600
in the Destiny Book

24:56.680 --> 24:58.640
and let what is fated happen.

24:58.720 --> 25:00.280
Then the tribulation
can be considered a success.

25:01.240 --> 25:02.680
It's so complicated.

25:03.560 --> 25:04.680
It's not.

25:04.760 --> 25:06.320
Let me give you an example.

25:07.000 --> 25:09.880
Destiny Books
are like the novels of Yunmeng Lake.

25:10.440 --> 25:12.960
The fate poem is the story in the novels.

25:13.520 --> 25:14.680
In a novel, it records

25:14.760 --> 25:16.520
when a mortal was born,

25:16.600 --> 25:17.880
when he will be a number one scholar,

25:17.960 --> 25:19.640
and when he'll marry and have children.

25:20.360 --> 25:21.280
Although the fate poem

25:21.360 --> 25:23.640
is not as detailed
as the stories in the novel,

25:23.720 --> 25:26.280
it still shows
the major events in one's life.

25:27.560 --> 25:29.040
Hence,

25:29.120 --> 25:30.520
if a person is written to be

25:30.600 --> 25:31.960
a number one scholar

25:32.040 --> 25:33.840
and a high-ranking officer on a day,

25:33.920 --> 25:36.440
but there was an accident
on his way to the exam,

25:36.520 --> 25:38.600
causing him to miss it
and not become the number one scholar,

25:39.080 --> 25:40.440
this will be considered
a failed tribulation?

25:40.520 --> 25:41.520
Yes.

25:42.880 --> 25:44.320
So what if one fails?

25:45.240 --> 25:46.840
It will damage his cultivation at least,

25:46.920 --> 25:48.240
or his soul will dissipate.

25:48.320 --> 25:50.120
A high immortal
with more powerful cultivation

25:50.200 --> 25:51.760
will face more dangerous tribulations.

25:53.360 --> 25:54.800
That means

25:54.880 --> 25:56.640
if a high god
goes to experience tribulations

25:56.720 --> 25:58.600
but he dies when he's still a baby,

25:58.680 --> 26:00.440
his primordial spirit will dissipate?

26:01.120 --> 26:01.960
Yes.

26:02.040 --> 26:04.800
So unless there is a reason
why they must go,

26:04.880 --> 26:07.560
generally speaking, high gods won't go
to experience tribulations.

26:12.800 --> 26:13.760
Jieli,

26:13.840 --> 26:16.800
when did you start being interested
in these things?

26:16.880 --> 26:20.200
I remember you never listened when I
complained about how troublesome it is

26:20.280 --> 26:21.600
to fix Destiny Books.

26:24.040 --> 26:25.880
By the way,
that room hasn't been cleaned yet.

26:25.960 --> 26:26.920
Go and clean it.

26:27.720 --> 26:29.360
I just did.

26:29.440 --> 26:31.080
Then clean it again.

26:31.160 --> 26:32.480
Hurry. Go.

26:34.640 --> 26:35.520
Hurry up.

26:35.600 --> 26:36.440
Clean it well.

26:36.520 --> 26:37.360
All right.

26:45.720 --> 26:46.600
Greetings, my lord.

26:50.040 --> 26:51.480
I understand now.

26:53.720 --> 26:54.640
My lord,

26:54.720 --> 26:56.640
I've already asked everything

26:56.720 --> 26:58.000
you wanted to know.

26:58.800 --> 26:59.960
My lord, from now on,

27:00.640 --> 27:03.440
can you stop thinking about killing me?

27:27.120 --> 27:29.360
"Half a lifetime of glory,
half a lifetime of dust.

27:29.440 --> 27:31.680
A magnificent dance stunned
the whole Lucheng.

27:31.760 --> 27:33.640
Her beauty is just like the willow's.

27:33.720 --> 27:36.000
She hears the flute
on the night of Lantern Festival."

27:36.080 --> 27:37.760
"She is heartbroken
and wants to end her life.

27:37.840 --> 27:40.080
Then she meets her beloved
who understands her well.

27:40.160 --> 27:42.480
They are destined to be together.

27:42.560 --> 27:45.240
Her husband kills her
on the wedding night."

27:49.600 --> 27:51.440
If the poem is correct,

27:51.520 --> 27:54.600
we'll have to wait until the wedding day,

27:55.160 --> 27:56.640
when she is killed by her husband,

27:56.720 --> 27:58.000
to get her primordial spirit.

27:58.640 --> 27:59.520
Is the fairy

27:59.600 --> 28:01.040
lying to us

28:01.800 --> 28:03.040
to buy some time?

28:04.280 --> 28:07.400
I asked Jieli to ask around

28:07.480 --> 28:09.240
to prevent her from being suspicious.

28:09.720 --> 28:11.320
Since she knew nothing,

28:11.400 --> 28:12.680
she wouldn't lie on purpose.

28:13.520 --> 28:14.400
Besides,

28:14.480 --> 28:16.760
her primordial spirit almost dissipated.

28:17.320 --> 28:19.240
That matches her words.

28:20.440 --> 28:21.320
It can't be fake.

28:22.240 --> 28:23.080
Moon Supreme.

28:24.360 --> 28:26.160
I still have a question.

28:27.840 --> 28:29.520
You kept that fairy

28:29.600 --> 28:31.000
to repair the Destiny Book before.

28:32.240 --> 28:33.840
Since the Destiny Book is fixed,

28:34.480 --> 28:36.600
why wouldn't you kill her?

28:39.320 --> 28:40.640
I can't kill her.

28:41.200 --> 28:42.320
Why?

28:43.800 --> 28:45.600
I have my reasons.

28:46.160 --> 28:48.200
Send the baby to Lucheng immediately.

28:48.280 --> 28:50.320
Don't delay her
from experiencing tribulations.

28:53.320 --> 28:54.440
Yes.

29:09.120 --> 29:11.080
Jieli only does things
that are beneficial to her.

29:11.160 --> 29:13.600
Why did she ask about experiencing
tribulations for no reason?

29:15.200 --> 29:17.200
If it wasn't Jieli who's curious about it,

29:17.280 --> 29:19.160
someone else must have asked her to do so.

29:19.920 --> 29:22.640
Who can order Jieli to work for him?

29:24.880 --> 29:26.080
Experiencing tribulations?

29:27.600 --> 29:28.720
Right,

29:28.800 --> 29:29.720
the Destiny Book.

29:30.240 --> 29:31.480
It's Dongfang Qingcang.

29:32.520 --> 29:34.080
Jieli asked about the high gods.

29:34.560 --> 29:37.080
Could it be that the mortal
named Xie Wanqing

29:37.160 --> 29:39.000
is a high god
who is experiencing tribulations?

29:40.680 --> 29:41.800
However,

29:41.880 --> 29:44.480
there are only
a few high gods in Shuiyuntian.

29:44.560 --> 29:46.400
How would I not know
if a high god was sent

29:46.480 --> 29:47.920
to experience tribulations?

29:49.680 --> 29:51.840
Master never told me about that too.

29:52.840 --> 29:54.200
And why was the Destiny Book

29:54.280 --> 29:56.360
hidden in Haishi?

30:09.600 --> 30:12.960
"Half a lifetime of glory,
half a lifetime of dust.

30:14.240 --> 30:17.200
A magnificent dance stunned
the whole Lucheng.

30:20.160 --> 30:23.040
Her beauty is just like the willow's.

30:23.880 --> 30:26.960
She hears the flute
on the night of Lantern Festival.

30:28.360 --> 30:31.080
She is heartbroken
and wants to end her life.

30:32.040 --> 30:35.200
Then she meets her beloved
who understands her well.

30:36.800 --> 30:39.680
They are destined to be together.

30:41.280 --> 30:45.320
Her husband kills her
on the wedding night."

30:50.600 --> 30:53.200
She died by her bridegroom's sword
on their wedding night.

30:53.280 --> 30:54.120
No.

30:54.200 --> 30:55.400
In every lifetime,

30:55.480 --> 30:57.120
she'll be killed by the one she loves.

30:57.680 --> 30:59.600
What a tragic fate.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.920
Hide well.

31:19.200 --> 31:20.240
Xie Wanqing.

31:21.240 --> 31:22.520
Who exactly are you?

31:23.560 --> 31:25.400
Why do I seem to have seen you before?

31:27.520 --> 31:28.760
Who am I then?

31:45.360 --> 31:46.840
Xie Wanqing.

31:47.760 --> 31:49.840
If she is really a high god
experiencing tribulations,

31:50.320 --> 31:52.800
and Dongfang Qingcang cares so much
about her Destiny Book,

31:52.880 --> 31:55.480
then he must want to find her
through the fate poem.

31:55.560 --> 31:58.520
He also asked Jieli to ask me
about the primordial spirit.

31:59.000 --> 32:01.200
Is he going to take the primordial spirit
of this high god?

32:02.040 --> 32:03.600
Orchid.

32:05.520 --> 32:06.920
What are you doing?

32:07.000 --> 32:10.320
Jieli, didn't you go to play chess
with Shangque?

32:10.400 --> 32:11.240
Why are you back?

32:11.320 --> 32:14.000
He went to Yunmeng Lake
with the Moon Supreme for some relaxation.

32:14.080 --> 32:15.480
They won't be back until tonight.

32:17.120 --> 32:18.000
I'm so bored.

32:18.960 --> 32:21.800
The time in the Moon and Fairy Realm
differs from the Mortal World.

32:21.880 --> 32:23.880
If he leaves for a few hours,

32:23.960 --> 32:26.200
wouldn't he be in the Mortal World
for a few months?

32:29.120 --> 32:30.000
Yunmeng Lake?

32:30.080 --> 32:30.960
Yes.

32:32.560 --> 32:33.600
I think

32:33.680 --> 32:34.640
you made him angry,

32:34.720 --> 32:35.800
so he wants to avoid you.

32:35.880 --> 32:37.880
Besides,
Lucheng is bustling with activity.

32:37.960 --> 32:40.160
It's more fun than the Silent Moon Palace.

32:41.080 --> 32:41.960
Lucheng?

32:42.600 --> 32:44.920
"A magnificent dance stunned
the whole Lucheng."

32:45.000 --> 32:46.880
It's where Xie Wanqing
will experience her tribulations.

32:47.720 --> 32:48.560
Jieli.

32:48.640 --> 32:50.800
Which year and month
is Yunmeng Lake in now?

32:52.920 --> 32:54.920
It should be the first month
of the Yisi Year.

32:55.400 --> 32:56.760
Why?

32:56.840 --> 32:57.800
Lucheng.

32:57.880 --> 32:59.160
The Lantern Festival.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.600
"The night of the Lantern Festival."

33:00.680 --> 33:01.880
"Meeting her beloved."

33:02.520 --> 33:03.400
That's right.

33:03.480 --> 33:05.720
Xie Wanqing will meet the one
destined for her

33:05.800 --> 33:07.280
at the Lantern Festival.

33:08.040 --> 33:10.120
His target must be Xie Wanqing.

33:10.200 --> 33:11.600
What is he going to do?

33:12.840 --> 33:14.200
Hey. What are you thinking about?

33:16.880 --> 33:18.040
Jieli, pack up.

33:18.120 --> 33:19.320
We're going to Lucheng too.

33:20.800 --> 33:21.880
Really?

33:22.640 --> 33:23.960
Are we really going to Lucheng?

33:24.040 --> 33:25.040
Hey.

33:27.080 --> 33:31.040
LUCHENG, YUNMENG LAKE

33:50.800 --> 33:51.640
Jieli.

33:51.720 --> 33:52.720
Let's go.

33:52.800 --> 33:55.680
I haven't been here for a while.
There are more new things in Yunmeng Lake.

34:00.280 --> 34:01.880
What? Let me have a look.

34:01.960 --> 34:02.800
Stop looking at it.

34:02.880 --> 34:04.240
They are gone.

34:04.320 --> 34:05.640
- Hurry.
- I still want to…

34:27.600 --> 34:28.960
Who allowed you to come?

34:45.880 --> 34:47.440
Didn't I tell you

34:47.520 --> 34:49.920
that you can't go out without my order?

34:51.239 --> 34:54.280
Since I am the mighty Moon Supreme Lord,

34:54.360 --> 34:55.560
why didn't you obey my order?

34:57.920 --> 34:59.000
Go back.

35:01.880 --> 35:02.760
Shangque.

35:04.560 --> 35:06.800
Take them back
to Silent Moon Palace immediately.

35:06.880 --> 35:07.800
Yes.

35:08.920 --> 35:10.680
She wants to accompany you here, my lord.

35:13.400 --> 35:15.360
Orchid kept sighing

35:15.440 --> 35:16.800
in the garden earlier.

35:16.880 --> 35:17.840
She said

35:17.920 --> 35:20.320
that she shouldn't have made you angry
a few days ago.

35:20.400 --> 35:21.320
She felt guilty.

35:21.400 --> 35:22.920
And seeing you being upset,

35:23.000 --> 35:23.960
she was very worried,

35:24.040 --> 35:26.280
so she wanted to accompany you here.

35:31.600 --> 35:32.440
Yes.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.200
My lord.

35:38.280 --> 35:40.040
Since Fairy Orchid cares about you,

35:40.640 --> 35:43.120
why don't we let her come with us?

36:02.080 --> 36:03.000
My lord,

36:03.640 --> 36:04.720
can I walk around?

36:09.240 --> 36:10.920
Me too. I want to do that too.

36:11.000 --> 36:11.920
No.

36:12.600 --> 36:13.480
Don't…

36:14.320 --> 36:15.160
I'll go ahead.

36:34.400 --> 36:35.280
Here, take care.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.200
Thank you, sir.

36:36.800 --> 36:38.000
Sugar figures.

36:38.080 --> 36:39.480
Come and see the sugar figures.

36:39.560 --> 36:40.440
Sugar figures.

36:41.320 --> 36:43.280
Come and see the sugar figures.

36:43.360 --> 36:44.400
Check out the sugar figures.

36:44.880 --> 36:45.720
Sir.

36:46.200 --> 36:47.880
- How many spirit stones does this cost?
- What?

36:47.960 --> 36:49.440
How many spirit stones does this cost?

36:55.400 --> 36:56.440
Are these enough?

36:56.520 --> 36:58.640
He looks handsome and talented,

36:58.720 --> 37:00.440
but I didn't expect him to be a fool.

37:00.520 --> 37:02.240
He's buying sugar figures with jewelry.

37:04.080 --> 37:05.480
Your spirit stones are too small.

37:05.560 --> 37:06.480
They're not enough.

37:06.560 --> 37:08.880
These sugar figures are made
from ancestral craftsmanship.

37:08.960 --> 37:10.360
I'm the 18th generation.

37:10.440 --> 37:12.480
You can't find this anywhere else
in Lucheng.

37:14.480 --> 37:15.560
Are these enough now?

37:15.640 --> 37:16.520
Yes.

37:18.280 --> 37:20.920
How dare you cheat people in front of me?

37:22.600 --> 37:23.520
He wanted

37:23.600 --> 37:25.320
to buy these himself.

37:26.120 --> 37:27.440
A sugar figure

37:27.520 --> 37:28.760
only costs three to five cents.

37:28.840 --> 37:30.040
Give them back.

37:31.240 --> 37:33.840
I don't give refunds.

37:38.720 --> 37:39.600
Come here.

37:39.680 --> 37:40.880
Come over here.

37:40.960 --> 37:42.800
Please be the judge for me.

37:43.360 --> 37:45.200
This scammer
pretended to sell sugar figures

37:45.280 --> 37:48.120
and cheated over ten gems from my brother.

37:48.600 --> 37:49.440
Look.

37:49.520 --> 37:51.840
You may be unable to tell
that my brother is stupid.

37:51.920 --> 37:53.240
- What happened?
- It's still like this?

37:53.320 --> 37:54.160
That's not business.

37:54.240 --> 37:55.880
He has had a brain disease
since childhood.

37:55.960 --> 37:57.200
How could this happen?

37:57.280 --> 37:59.280
- It's bullying.
- How can he do business like that?

37:59.880 --> 38:00.720
Tell me.

38:00.800 --> 38:02.480
Isn't he bullying him?

38:02.560 --> 38:04.440
- Yes.
- It's bullying.

38:04.520 --> 38:06.200
Please be the judge for me.

38:06.280 --> 38:07.880
- How can he do business like that?
- Yes.

38:07.960 --> 38:08.920
- Bully.
- Yes.

38:09.000 --> 38:10.720
- Right.
- He's so bad.

38:10.800 --> 38:11.960
You're bullying a sick person.

38:12.040 --> 38:13.240
You're heartless.

38:13.320 --> 38:14.440
Give me back the gems.

38:15.320 --> 38:16.560
Here you go.

38:17.680 --> 38:18.600
Just my luck.

38:20.440 --> 38:21.520
Wait.

38:22.200 --> 38:23.960
You tricked us. How can you leave now?

38:24.040 --> 38:25.880
What else do you want?

38:25.960 --> 38:28.480
Compensate my brother for scaring him.

38:29.480 --> 38:31.080
Give me two sugar figures.

38:31.760 --> 38:33.240
- Give them to her.
- That's right.

38:33.320 --> 38:35.240
- Give them to her.
- That's right.

38:35.320 --> 38:36.680
- Compensate them.
- Hurry.

38:36.760 --> 38:38.200
- He's not giving them?
- Goodness.

38:41.840 --> 38:43.640
- How deceitful.
- Yes.

38:44.960 --> 38:47.040
- How clever.
- Goodness.

38:47.120 --> 38:49.240
- I won't buy it anymore.
- It's easy to see girls being bullied.

38:50.480 --> 38:51.800
You may go now.

38:51.880 --> 38:52.800
Thank you, everyone.

38:52.880 --> 38:54.520
It's fine. Let's go.

38:54.600 --> 38:55.600
You're good.

38:55.680 --> 38:56.760
Of course.

38:56.840 --> 38:57.920
He wanted to trick me?

38:58.000 --> 38:59.480
He's playing tricks in front of a master.

39:00.840 --> 39:02.240
Stupid Black Dragon,

39:02.320 --> 39:04.440
you used to be imposing
in Silent Moon Palace.

39:04.520 --> 39:06.400
Why didn't you use your brain this time?

39:06.480 --> 39:08.120
How is this stupid sugar figure

39:08.200 --> 39:09.520
worth so many spirit stones?

39:09.600 --> 39:11.520
The sugar figure is interesting.

39:11.600 --> 39:13.120
And I've never seen it in Cangyan Sea.

39:13.680 --> 39:15.040
I remember you like sweets,

39:15.640 --> 39:17.160
so I just wanted to buy it for you.

39:22.960 --> 39:23.800
Forget it.

39:23.880 --> 39:25.800
Since you're so thoughtful,

39:25.880 --> 39:28.240
from now on,
I'm the only one who can deceive you.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.840
If anyone else dares to deceive you,

39:29.920 --> 39:31.320
I won't let him off the hook.

39:50.480 --> 39:53.400
Where are Shangque and Jieli?

39:56.360 --> 39:58.200
After seeing interesting things
in Mortal World,

39:58.680 --> 40:00.840
he even left his post without permission.

40:00.920 --> 40:01.880
I must punish him.

40:12.040 --> 40:13.200
Moon Supreme Lord.

40:18.080 --> 40:19.080
Thank you.

40:21.440 --> 40:23.000
I made you angry.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.400
But you didn't blame me

40:26.120 --> 40:28.560
and still allowed me
to accompany you here.

40:32.480 --> 40:33.440
There's no need to thank me.

40:34.320 --> 40:35.600
Since you said

40:35.680 --> 40:37.080
that we have no ties of comradeship,

40:37.160 --> 40:38.840
I have nothing to blame you for.

40:39.320 --> 40:40.480
Having you here

40:40.560 --> 40:42.200
means having one more person to serve me.

40:49.200 --> 40:51.320
Since you and I are not friends,

40:51.400 --> 40:54.040
don't say these empty words anymore.

40:54.120 --> 40:55.280
I don't like to hear them.

40:57.240 --> 40:58.120
All right.

41:00.240 --> 41:01.920
Can you say anything else besides that?

41:04.160 --> 41:05.520
I'm afraid that if I say too much,

41:05.600 --> 41:06.840
I will make you angry.

41:06.920 --> 41:08.080
Yes.

41:08.560 --> 41:10.560
It's good to talk less.

41:17.360 --> 41:19.520
I told you it's right to take me with you.

41:19.600 --> 41:22.640
Otherwise, when your dragon scales
are stripped to make clothes

41:22.720 --> 41:24.520
and your dragon tendons are taken
to make belts,

41:24.600 --> 41:26.880
you'd even help them count money.

41:28.400 --> 41:30.280
Why are you laughing? Let me ask you.

41:30.360 --> 41:31.520
Do you recognize copper coins?

41:31.600 --> 41:33.600
Do you know how many you can get
with a silver ingot

41:33.680 --> 41:34.880
and what you can buy?

41:39.720 --> 41:41.080
Since we are in Yunmeng Lake,

41:41.160 --> 41:43.520
we have to go by the rules here.

41:44.080 --> 41:46.240
We should follow the rules of mortals.

41:46.920 --> 41:49.000
Do not attract attention.

41:49.560 --> 41:51.080
I am the rule.

41:53.040 --> 41:54.520
No.

41:54.600 --> 41:55.800
My master said

41:55.880 --> 41:57.880
that Yunmeng Lake has its own destiny.

41:57.960 --> 42:00.280
Neither the Moon Tribe nor the Fairy Realm

42:00.360 --> 42:01.760
is allowed to interfere.

42:02.320 --> 42:04.120
If we act impulsively

42:04.200 --> 42:07.080
and disturb the fate of mortals,

42:07.160 --> 42:10.080
their primordial spirits might dissipate.

42:12.040 --> 42:13.520
In that case,

42:13.600 --> 42:16.120
if we affect Lady Chidi
in experiencing tribulations,

42:16.200 --> 42:17.320
it will be troublesome.

42:20.480 --> 42:21.400
Jieli.

42:23.280 --> 42:25.840
This is your fault.

42:26.320 --> 42:27.360
Yes.

42:28.720 --> 42:31.920
Moon Supreme is born with great talents

42:32.000 --> 42:33.440
and amazing power.

42:33.520 --> 42:35.040
Who doesn't respect him?

42:35.120 --> 42:38.360
Being an ordinary mortal

42:38.440 --> 42:40.360
is too hard on him.

42:41.840 --> 42:42.800
Yes.

42:42.880 --> 42:44.640
I overstepped my boundaries.

42:47.920 --> 42:48.840
Hard?

42:49.880 --> 42:52.520
Is being a mortal
harder than subduing ancient monsters

42:52.600 --> 42:54.080
and ruling three armies?

42:54.560 --> 42:56.640
Even if I become a mortal,

42:56.720 --> 42:58.240
I can be the best one.

43:00.640 --> 43:01.480
Jieli.

43:02.000 --> 43:02.840
Yes.

43:03.360 --> 43:04.200
Go on.

43:04.280 --> 43:06.160
What should a mortal do?

43:07.080 --> 43:09.120
Well, the most important thing

43:09.200 --> 43:10.080
in being a mortal

43:10.160 --> 43:12.600
is that you can't use your power freely.

43:12.680 --> 43:14.440
And you can't be seen by others using it.

43:15.880 --> 43:16.960
What else?

43:17.560 --> 43:18.720
Also,

43:20.040 --> 43:21.480
you have to change your title

43:21.560 --> 43:22.720
to avoid suspicion.

43:23.360 --> 43:25.120
You will no longer be Moon Supreme here.

43:28.120 --> 43:29.200
Well…

43:31.040 --> 43:31.880
Well…

43:31.960 --> 43:34.360
The leader of Yunmeng Lake

43:34.440 --> 43:36.720
is the emperor.

43:38.000 --> 43:39.760
Then I am the emperor.

43:46.320 --> 43:47.880
You may not know this,

43:47.960 --> 43:49.480
but there can only

43:49.560 --> 43:50.680
be one emperor.

43:52.040 --> 43:53.280
This is simple.

43:53.360 --> 43:54.720
I'll kill him.

43:55.680 --> 43:56.840
No!

43:56.920 --> 43:57.880
We can't change anything

43:57.960 --> 43:59.120
in the Mortal World.

43:59.200 --> 44:00.920
The mortals' spirits will dissipate.

44:01.000 --> 44:01.920
Then tell me.

44:02.400 --> 44:03.720
Who should I be?

44:07.560 --> 44:09.560
With your bearing,

44:09.640 --> 44:11.200
you must be rich or noble.

44:11.280 --> 44:13.920
Of course a normal status
is not suitable for you.

44:15.720 --> 44:16.760
In my opinion,

44:18.040 --> 44:19.000
you should be

44:21.640 --> 44:24.520
a rich businessman from Jinling,

44:24.600 --> 44:25.560
Mr. Dongfang.

44:25.640 --> 44:27.760
You're a genius in business
and you're super rich.

44:27.840 --> 44:29.960
That means you're more powerful
than the emperor.

44:30.040 --> 44:32.600
Even the shoulder pole used
by your servant is made of pure gold.

44:33.200 --> 44:35.480
Recently, you brought your family
to settle in Lucheng.

44:39.080 --> 44:41.080
What do you think, my lord?

44:45.080 --> 44:46.320
And Orchid,

44:46.400 --> 44:48.080
you can't be a fairy of Shuiyuntian.

44:48.800 --> 44:51.480
You are the gardening maid

44:51.560 --> 44:52.960
in Mr. Dongfang's mansion.

44:58.080 --> 44:59.240
As for me,

44:59.320 --> 45:01.320
I'm just the accounting maid

45:01.400 --> 45:02.640
who is in charge of the money.

45:03.760 --> 45:05.120
I'm not a fairy

45:06.280 --> 45:07.640
and he's not the Moon Supreme?

45:11.880 --> 45:13.680
It would be good if that's true.

45:13.760 --> 45:16.480
Shangque is still a guard
in Mr. Dongfang's mansion.

45:17.000 --> 45:18.200
What do you think?

45:20.160 --> 45:21.200
It's complete then.

45:21.920 --> 45:23.320
Everyone,

45:23.400 --> 45:24.880
let's get into the role.

45:35.920 --> 45:36.920
Mister…

45:41.160 --> 45:42.440
Mr. Dongfang.

45:48.840 --> 45:49.920
That's right.

45:53.400 --> 45:55.320
By the way,
since you're a rich businessman,

45:55.400 --> 45:57.320
we have another important thing to do,

45:57.880 --> 45:58.960
which is to buy

45:59.040 --> 46:01.400
a big, grand house in Lucheng.

46:06.400 --> 46:13.240
DONGFANG MANSION

46:25.400 --> 46:26.600
Look.
